+# Local to-do app
+
+Open `index.html` in a browser. Tasks are saved in that browser's `localStorage`, so they remain after reloading the page. Data is local to the browser and origin; clearing site data removes it.
+
+Run `pnpm check` for the task lifecycle and saved-data checks. The app has no build step or runtime dependencies.
